erName":"リディア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"93701","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"137867"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19865"],"vndbCharacterId":"c46416"},"originalCharacterName":"リディア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a princess from a country that is now dead due to war. She was brought under Claude by the barbarian king who attacked her homeland, and in exchange for the lives of the king and queen who were taken hostage, she chose the path of the barbarian king's sex slaves. White Princess; as the name suggests, she has a beautiful appearance, but she is active and somewhat short-tempered who always picks fights with Claude and Elliot."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c46416"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"誇り高く、強い意志を持つ可憐な城の姫君。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"祖国を蛮族に侵略され、父母を人質に奪われたことから、調律の館へと送り込まれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公に対しても、毅然とした態度を崩さず抵抗するものの、その肌は人一倍敏感に過ぎ、自分を律しようとする高貴な心と、快楽を欲する女の性（さが）の狭間で苦悩する。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19865","sourceWorkId":"9456","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"気高い心と勇気を胸に抱く可憐な白の姫君。 祖国を侵略した蛮族の手によって調律の館へ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親である王と王妃を人質に取られており、館での辱めに健気に立ち向かおうとする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし…男に初めて触れられるにもかかわらず、その身体はあまりに敏感すぎ、誇り高い彼女の心を激しく苛むのである。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"93701"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/97/97319964dd8a6d20f3d1d3a28929b726c19def221246e033d58025da179a0503.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/47/4755e44c270eec97c50950068057f0b2b374d34cf43709c3bbeaacad5e32bbf1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"橘志穂","creatorId":"vndb:s738","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s738","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s738","name":"橘 志穂","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:137867:93701:7169:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c46417","characterName":"ヒルダ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"93702","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"137867"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19866"],"vndbCharacterId":"c46417"},"originalCharacterName":"ヒルダ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A solitary black princess with an air of indescribable elegance. She is the sacred princess priestess of the northern religious nation."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After the death of the former king, she was supposed to become queen, but was thrown into the Tuning Hall by her brother, the Duke, who was trying to succeed her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At first, she is reluctant to let go of her aloofness, but gradually becomes interested in the pleasure she experiences for the first time."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c46417"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"北方に位置する宗教国家の神聖な姫巫女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"前王が崩御し、彼女が後継として女王になるはずだったが、跡目を狙う兄の姦計によって、奴隷として調律の館へと送られる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"犯し難い気品を感じさせながらも、主人公や調律に興味を持っているらしく、調律に対して従順な態度を示すが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19866","sourceWorkId":"9456","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"犯しがたい気品を漂わせる孤高の黒の王女。 北方の宗教国家の神聖な姫巫女である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"前王が崩御し、女王となるはずであったが、跡目を狙う実兄である公爵の姦計により、調律の館に投げ落とされる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最初は超然とした態度をなかなか崩さないが、初めて体験する快楽に次第に興味を抱き出す。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"93702"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/759b04d9ecc8e9d3910012266ae13caf23926049377761cc8603b5f9ef77ccae.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/79c11d5a29878f5e731f69dcf27856331def84971f756695d298de4a497a4e5a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"さくらなつみ","creatorId":"vndb:s666","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s666","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s666","name":"岩泉まい(樋口まゆら、樋口まゆ)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:137867:93702:6279:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c46418","characterName":"エレノア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"93703","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"137867"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19867"],"vndbCharacterId":"c46418"},"originalCharacterName":"エレノア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"祝福されし、長命の種族・メトセラの第一王妃。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以前は敬虔だった種族も今や堕落し、王侯貴族間でも性奴隷の質を競い合うようになっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女の夫である少年王も例外ではなく、妻である彼女を最高の性奴隷にするべく調律の館へ送り届ける。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫への愛情に疑念を感じながらも、その既に開発された肉体は、執拗に加えられる調律にも素直な快楽の反応を見せる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19867","sourceWorkId":"9456","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"祝福されし長命の種族メトセラの第一王妃。彼女の夫である少年王はエレノアに命ずる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最高の性奴○になって戻ることを…夫への愛情と疑い…複雑な想いを秘めて、エレノアは調律師の手に堕ちる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"すでに開発された成熟した身体は、執拗に加えられる調律に抗うことは出来ない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"93703"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/9456f0072d09f0736f40976f047ff9e41e5bf70f5c08fecc3212ffd2e006f29c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/33/331c14baa883e0c24abd4bd8e1474695540fea90c7991af5709496c30944d023.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高城みつ","creatorId":"vndb:s29","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s29","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s29","name":"高城 みつ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:137867:93703:6469:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c79247","characterName":"ノーラ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"93704","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"137867"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19868"],"vndbCharacterId":"c79247"},"originalCharacterName":"ノーラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"赤子の時に捨てられた主人公を拾って、世界屈指の調律師に育てた淫魔。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虚弱なクロードは、彼女との性交によって精気を得なければ生き永らえることが出来ない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そうしたことから、彼女の糧となる人の堕落と絶望を得るため、調律の館で何人もの女達を性奴隷に貶めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人を惑わす純粋な悪意である彼女は、淫らな策謀を巡らしては、持ち込まれる女達を破滅させて、それを至上の悦びとしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また彼女の体液には強い催淫効果を持つ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19868","sourceWorkId":"9456","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"赤子の時に捨てられた主人公を拾って、世界屈指の調律師に育てた淫魔。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虚弱なクロードは、彼女との性交によって精気を得なければ生き永らえることが出来ない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そうしたことから、彼女の糧となる人の堕落と絶望を得るため、調律の館で何人もの女達を性奴隷に貶めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人を惑わす純粋な悪意である彼女は、淫らな策謀を巡らしては、持ち込まれる女達を破滅させて、それを至上の悦びとしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また彼女の体液には強い催淫効果を持つ。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"93704"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9cf672e0a016e2895ca98e69332885c6237bdb5b88f8eeb1cc71dfae75fee3c5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/te